#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:70
msgid "PLUMED overview"
msgstr "PLUMED の概要"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:72
msgid ""
"PLUMED is a library that can be incorporated into many molecular dynamics "
"(MD) codes by adding a relatively simple and well documented interface. Once"
" it is incorporated you can use PLUMED to perform on-the-fly a variety of "
"different analyses and to bias the sampling in MD simulations. Additionally,"
" PLUMED can be used as a standalone code for analyzing trajectories. If you "
"want to use the code in this way, you can run the PLUMED executable by "
"issuing the command:"
msgstr ""
"PLUMED は、比較的単純で詳しく文書化された Interface を追加することで、多くの Molecular Dynamics (MD) "
"コードに組み込めるライブラリです。組み込むと、MD 中にさまざまな解析を On-the-fly に行い、Sampling に Bias "
"を加えられます。また、Trajectory 解析用の独立したコードとしても使えます。その場合は、次のコマンドで PLUMED を実行します。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:78
msgid ""
"Let's start by getting a feel for the range of calculations that PLUMED can "
"do. Issue the following command now:"
msgstr "まず PLUMED でできる計算の範囲を把握しましょう。次のコマンドを実行してください。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:84
msgid ""
"The output of this command is the list of tools included in PLUMED. Among "
"these, there are commands that allow you to patch an MD code, postprocess "
"metadynamics simulations, and build the manual. In this class we will use "
"PLUMED to analyze trajectories. In order to do so, we will learn how to use "
"the driver command line tool. Let's look at the options of PLUMED driver by "
"issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"出力には PLUMED に含まれるツールが一覧表示されます。MD コードへの Patch、Metadynamics "
"の後処理、マニュアルの作成などのコマンドがあります。この講義では Trajectory の解析に使うため、driver "
"コマンドラインツールを学びます。次のコマンドで PLUMED driver のオプションを確認しましょう。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:90
